{"id":"653214","name":"凉拌莲藕","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653214/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲藕","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"烧烤粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎备用。","img":"images/653214/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末，盐，鸡精，烧烤粉，辣椒粉。","img":"images/653214/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味。","img":"images/653214/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量生抽，蚝油，陈醋搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/653214/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"莲藕去皮洗净。","img":"images/653214/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将莲藕切薄片后泡入水中。","img":"images/653214/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中水烧开，放入莲藕煮开2分钟左右。","img":"images/653214/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮好的藕片捞出过下凉水。","img":"images/653214/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"淋上拌汁。","img":"images/653214/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入香菜拌匀即可。","img":"images/653214/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653214/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653214/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653214/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}